   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<     \[Bullet] \
\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[GothicCapitalD]\), \(5\)]\)(\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(r\), \
\(0\)]\)) = 0.\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", "\"\<     \[Bullet] For \[Chi] < 0\>\"", "]"}], 
    ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<       \[Checkmark] \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(r\), \(0\)]\) \
> 0\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<       \[Checkmark] the 6D_1 RCPC domain of r is \
restricted to r > \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(r\), \(0\)]\).\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<       \[Checkmark] As \
r\[Rule]\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(r\), \(0\)]\) from above, \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\
\[GothicCapitalD]\), \(5\)]\)\[Rule]0.\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<     \[Bullet] For \[Chi] > 0, \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\
\[GothicCapitalD]\), \(5\)]\) > 0 and so there is no domain restriction.\>\"",
      "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<Analogous to the original KK bubble, the radial line \
element for this solution is\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<     \!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(ds\), \(2\)]\) = \
\!\(\*FractionBox[\(1\), \(\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[GothicCapitalD]\), \
\(5\)]\)[r]\)]\) \!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(dr\), \(2\)]\) + \
\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[GothicCapitalD]\), \(5\)]\)[r] \
\!\(\*SuperscriptBox[SubscriptBox[\(p\), \(5\)], \(2\)]\) \
\!\(\*SuperscriptBox[SubscriptBox[\(d\[Psi]\), \(5\)], \(2\)]\)\>\"", "]"}], 
    ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<This is a good time to introduce some vocabulary.\>\"",
      "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<The full 6D spacetime contains 6 parameters, (t,r,\
\[Theta],\[Phi],\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[Psi]\), \(4\)]\),\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\
\[Psi]\), \(5\)]\)) and has an associated line element. The portion of the \
line element involving 3-space, (r,\[Theta],\[Phi]) is called the \
\!\(\*StyleBox[\"base\",FontWeight->\"Bold\"]\)\!\(\*StyleBox[\" \
\",FontWeight->\"Bold\"]\)\!\(\*StyleBox[\"line\",FontWeight->\"Bold\"]\)\!\(\
\*StyleBox[\" \
\",FontWeight->\"Bold\"]\)\!\(\*StyleBox[\"element\",FontWeight->\"Bold\"]\). \
Any other portion of the line element, such as the (r,\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\
\[Psi]\), \(5\)]\)) line element, above, is referred to as a \
\!\(\*StyleBox[\"transverse\",FontWeight->\"Bold\"]\)\!\(\*StyleBox[\" \
\",FontWeight->\"Bold\"]\)\!\(\*StyleBox[\"line\",FontWeight->\"Bold\"]\)\!\(\
\*StyleBox[\" \
\",FontWeight->\"Bold\"]\)\!\(\*StyleBox[\"element\",FontWeight->\"Bold\"]\).\
\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<In flat space, \!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(ds\), \(2\)]\) = \
\!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(dr\), \(2\)]\); i.e., the radial distance r equals the \
proper distance s. In curved space, they are not the same. Hence, to check \
whether the \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[Psi]\), \(5\)]\) circle shrinks smoothly \
down to zero, we have to use the proper distance, s.\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[GothicCapitalD]\), \(5\)]\)[r] \
\!\(\*SuperscriptBox[SubscriptBox[\(p\), \(5\)], \(2\)]\) is the square of \
the proper radius. So, our plan is to express \
\!\(\*SqrtBox[\(\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[GothicCapitalD]\), \
\(5\)]\)[r]\)]\)\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(p\), \(5\)]\), the proper radius, in \
terms of s, and then to examine the proper circumference, \
2\[Pi]\!\(\*SqrtBox[\(\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[GothicCapitalD]\), \
\(5\)]\)[r]\)]\)\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(p\), \(5\)]\).\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<As r\[RightArrow]\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(r\), \(0\)]\), \
the \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[Psi]\), \(5\)]\)-circle circumference \
2\[Pi]\!\(\*SqrtBox[\(\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[GothicCapitalD]\), \
\(5\)]\)[r]\)]\)\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(p\), \(5\)]\) shrinks down to zero. This \
is the bubble: the curled \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[Psi]\), \(5\)]\)-direction \
pinches off completely at r=\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(r\), \(0\)]\). As r moves \
away from \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(r\), \(0\)]\), spacetime continues \
outward.\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<Notice that as r\[Rule]\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(r\), \
\(0\)]\), \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[GothicCapitalD]\), \(5\)]\)\[Rule]0, the \
\!\(\*FractionBox[SuperscriptBox[\(dr\), \(2\)], SubscriptBox[\(\
\[GothicCapitalD]\), \(5\)]]\) term in \!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(ds\), \(2\)]\) \
gets large and the \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[GothicCapitalD]\), \
\(5\)]\)\!\(\*SuperscriptBox[SubscriptBox[\(p\), \(5\)], \
\(2\)]\)\!\(\*SuperscriptBox[SubscriptBox[\(d\[Psi]\), \(5\)], \(2\)]\) term \
gets small, so that \!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(ds\), \(2\)]\) \[TildeTilde] \
\!\(\*FractionBox[SuperscriptBox[\(dr\), \(2\)], \(\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\
\[GothicCapitalD]\), \(5\)]\)[r]\)]\) = \!\(\*FractionBox[SuperscriptBox[\(dr\
\), \(2\)], \(1 + \*FractionBox[\(\[Chi]\), \(r\)]\)]\). This is the metric \
we use to determine whether the pinch has a sharp point or is smooth.\>\"", 
     "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<The plots below help visualize the pinch. In the \
plots, \!\(\*SqrtBox[SubscriptBox[\(\[GothicCapitalD]\), \
\(5\)]]\)\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(p\), \(5\)]\) are the \nproper radii of the \
horizontal slices for various r-values. The upper plots \nshow 2D \
cross-sections of the height of the surface vs proper radii. \nThe lower \
plots revolve the upper plots to form surfaces of revolution in \nordinary \
3-space. \>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<With \[Chi]=-\!\(\*FractionBox[SubscriptBox[\(p\), \(5\
\)], \(2\)]\) the bottom is rounded (smooth); with \
\[Chi]=-\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(p\), \(5\)]\) it comes to a\nsharp point (a \
cone). The claim below show that \
\[Chi]=-\!\(\*FractionBox[SubscriptBox[\(p\), \(5\)], \(2\)]\) is the only \
value\nthat gives a smooth bottom. (Note: the plot uses \
\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(p\), \(5\)]\)=1.)\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"p5", " ", "=", " ", "1"}], ";"}], "  ", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"circle", " ", "radius"}], ";", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
      "the", " ", "plot", " ", "ranges", " ", "below", " ", "assume", " ", 
       "p5"}], " ", "=", " ", "1"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["p", "5"], "=", "1"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\[Chi]", "=", "chi"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"height", "[", "chi_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"r0", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"-", "chi"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{"NDSolveValue", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"z", "'"}], "[", "u", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
            RowBox[{"2", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
              RowBox[{"r0", " ", "+", " ", 
               RowBox[{"u", "^", "2"}]}], "]"}], " ", 
             RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
              RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"p5", "^", "2"}], " ", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"chi", "^", "2"}], "/", 
                 RowBox[{"(", 
                  RowBox[{"4", " ", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{"r0", " ", "+", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"u", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}], "^", "4"}]}], 
                  ")"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"z", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "0"}]}], "}"}], ",",
          " ", "z", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"u", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], 
      "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"radius", "[", 
      RowBox[{"chi_", ",", " ", "u_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"p5", " ", 
      RowBox[{"u", "/", 
       RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "chi"}], " ", "+", " ", 
         RowBox[{"u", "^", "2"}]}], "]"}]}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"2", "D", " ", "cross"}], "-", "sections"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"side", " ", "by", " ", "side"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"profile", "[", 
      RowBox[{"chi_", ",", " ", "label_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"With", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"zf", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"height", "[", "chi", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{"ParametricPlot", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"radius", "[", 
              RowBox[{"chi", ",", " ", "u"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"zf", "[", "u", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"-", 
              RowBox[{"radius", "[", 
               RowBox[{"chi", ",", " ", "u"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"zf", "[", "u", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"u", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
         "    ", 
         RowBox[{"PlotStyle", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Directive", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Blue", ",", " ", "Thick"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"AspectRatio", " ", "->", " ", "Automatic"}], ",", "\n", 
         "    ", 
         RowBox[{"PlotRange", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"-", "1.1"}], ",", " ", "1.1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "2.5"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Axes", " ", "->", " ", "False"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
         RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           
           RowBox[{"\"\<proper radius of the \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[Psi]\), \
\(5\)]\) circle\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<height of the drawn surface\>\""}], 
           "}"}]}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
         RowBox[{"PlotLabel", " ", "->", " ", "label"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"ImageSize", " ", "->", " ", "330"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
    ";"}], "\n", "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
     RowBox[{"GraphicsRow", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"profile", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"-", "p5"}], "/", "2"}], ",", 
          " ", "\"\<\[Chi] = -\!\(\*FractionBox[SubscriptBox[\(p\), \(5\)], \
\(2\)]\): smooth, rounded bottom\>\""}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"profile", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"-", "p5"}], ",", 
          " ", "\"\<\[Chi] = -\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(p\), \(5\)]\): sharp \
conical tip\>\""}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Optional", ":", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "the", " ", "same", " ", "two", " ", "surfaces", " ", "in", " ", "3", 
      "D"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"surface", "[", 
      RowBox[{"chi_", ",", " ", "label_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"With", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"zf", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"height", "[", "chi", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{"ParametricPlot3D", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"radius", "[", 
             RowBox[{"chi", ",", " ", "u"}], "]"}], " ", 
            RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "t", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"radius", "[", 
             RowBox[{"chi", ",", " ", "u"}], "]"}], " ", 
            RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "t", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"zf", "[", "u", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"u", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"2", " ", "Pi"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"PlotRange", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"-", "1.1"}], ",", " ", "1.1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"-", "1.1"}], ",", " ", "1.1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "2.5"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", 
         "    ", 
         RowBox[{"BoxRatios", " ", "->", " ", "Automatic"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Mesh", " ", "->", " ", "12"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"PlotLabel", " ", "->", " ", "label"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"ImageSize", " ", "->", " ", "330"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
    ";"}], "\n", "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
     RowBox[{"GraphicsRow", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"surface", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"-", 
           FractionBox[
            SubscriptBox["p", "5"], "2"]}], ",", 
          " ", "\"\<\[Chi] = -\!\(\*FractionBox[SubscriptBox[\(p\), \(5\)], \
\(2\)]\)\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"surface", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"-", 
           SubscriptBox["p", "5"]}], ",", 
          " ", "\"\<\[Chi] = -\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(p\), \(5\)]\)\>\""}], 
         "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["p", "5"], "=."}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"Clear", "[", "\[Chi]", "]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Claim: smoothness of the pinch places a constraint on \
\[Chi]: \[Chi] = \>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", 
        FractionBox["1", "2"]}], 
       SubscriptBox["p", "5"]}]}], "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\< \[Implies]  \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[GothicCapitalD]\), \
\(5\)]\)[r] = 1 + \!\(\*FractionBox[\(\[Chi]\), \(r\)]\) = 1 - \
\!\(\*FractionBox[SubscriptBox[\(p\), \(5\)], \(2  r\)]\).\>\"", "]"}], ";"}],
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", "\"\<Proof of claim:\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<   Slope of the tangent line of \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\
\[GothicCapitalD]\), \(5\)]\) at \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(r\), \(0\)]\) is\>\"", 
     "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<      m = \!\(\*SuperscriptBox[SubscriptBox[\"\
\[GothicCapitalD]\", \"5\"], \
FormBox[StyleBox[\"\[Prime]\",FontSize->13,FontWeight->\"Regular\",FontSlant->\
\"Plain\"],TraditionalForm]]\)(\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(r\), \(0\)]\)) = \
-\!\(\*FractionBox[\(\[Chi]\), SuperscriptBox[\(r\), \
\(2\)]]\)\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(|\), SubscriptBox[\(r\), \(0\)]]\) = \
-\!\(\*FractionBox[\(\[Chi]\), SuperscriptBox[\((\(-\[Chi]\))\), \(2\)]]\) = \
-\!\(\*FractionBox[\(1\), \(\[Chi]\)]\).\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<   For r near \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(r\), \(0\)]\), the \
tangent line is a 1st order approximation to \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\
\[GothicCapitalD]\), \(5\)]\).\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<   Set r \[Congruent] \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(r\), \(0\)]\
\) + \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[Delta]\), \(r\)]\) for r near to \
\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(r\), \(0\)]\). Since \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\
\[GothicCapitalD]\), \(5\)]\)[\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(r\), \(0\)]\)]=0, using y-\
\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(y\), \(0\)]\)=m(x-\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(x\), \(0\)]\)) we \
get,\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<      \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[GothicCapitalD]\), \(5\)]\
\)[r] = \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[GothicCapitalD]\), \
\(5\)]\)[r]-\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[GothicCapitalD]\), \
\(5\)]\)[\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(r\), \(0\)]\)] \[TildeTilde] \
m(r-\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(r\), \(0\)]\)) = m \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[Delta]\), \
\(r\)]\).\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<    \[Implies] ds \[TildeTilde] \!\(\*FractionBox[\(dr\
\), SqrtBox[\(\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[GothicCapitalD]\), \(5\)]\)[r]\)]]\) \
\[TildeTilde] \!\(\*FractionBox[\(dr\), SqrtBox[\(m\\\ \*SubscriptBox[\(\
\[Delta]\), \(r\)]\)]]\)\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<    \[Implies]  s \[TildeTilde] \!\(\*SubsuperscriptBox[\(\
\[Integral]\), SubscriptBox[\(r\), \(0\)], \(r\)]\)\!\(\*FractionBox[\(1\), \
SqrtBox[\(m\\\ \*SubscriptBox[\(\[Delta]\), \(\[Rho]\)]\)]]\)\[DifferentialD]\
\[Rho] = \!\(\*SubsuperscriptBox[\(\[Integral]\), SubscriptBox[\(r\), \(0\)], \
\(r\)]\)\!\(\*FractionBox[\(1\), SqrtBox[\(m\\\ \((\[Rho] - \
\*SubscriptBox[\(r\), \(0\)])\)\)]]\)\[DifferentialD]\[Rho] = \>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{
       SubsuperscriptBox["\[Integral]", 
        SubscriptBox["r", "0"], "r"], 
       RowBox[{
        FractionBox["1", 
         SqrtBox[
          RowBox[{"m", " ", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "-", 
             SubscriptBox["r", "0"]}], ")"}]}]]], 
        RowBox[{"\[DifferentialD]", "\[Rho]"}]}]}], 
      ",", "\"\< = 2\!\(\*SqrtBox[FractionBox[SubscriptBox[\(\[Delta]\), \
\(r\)], \(m\)]]\)\>\""}], "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<    \[Implies] \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[Delta]\), \(r\)]\) \
\[TildeTilde] \>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{
       FractionBox["1", "4"], "m", " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["s", "2"]}]}], "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<    \[Implies] \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[GothicCapitalD]\), \
\(5\)]\)(r) \[TildeTilde] m \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[Delta]\), \(r\)]\) = \>\"",
       ",", 
      RowBox[{
       FractionBox["1", "4"], 
       SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], 
       SuperscriptBox["s", "2"]}]}], "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<    We have expressed \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\
\[GothicCapitalD]\), \(5\)]\) in terms of proper distance, s.\>\"", "]"}], 
    ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<    We use this to determine the \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\
\[Psi]\), \(5\)]\) circle's proper physical circumference.\>\"", "]"}], ";"}],
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<    Recall from above that \>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{
       SqrtBox[
        RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[GothicCapitalD]", "5"], "[", "r", "]"}]], 
       SubscriptBox["p", "5"]}], 
      ",", "\"\< is the proper physical radius for the \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\
\[Psi]\), \(5\)]\) circle. \>\""}], "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", "\"\<    In terms of s (rather than r),\>\"", "]"}],
     ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<       Proper radius = \>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{
       SqrtBox[
        RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[GothicCapitalD]", "5"], "[", "r", "]"}]], 
       SubscriptBox["p", "5"]}], ",", "\"\< \[TildeTilde] \>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{
       FractionBox["1", "2"], "m", " ", 
       SubscriptBox["p", "5"], " ", "s"}]}], "]"}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<    Since \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[Psi]\), \(5\)]\) \
sweeps its full range of 2\[Pi], the actual physical circumference is\>\"", 
     "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<       Proper circumference = 2\[Pi] Proper radius = \>\"", 
      ",", 
      RowBox[{"\[Pi]", " ", "m", " ", 
       SubscriptBox["p", "5"], "s"}]}], "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<    If the circumference doesn't equal 2\[Pi]s \
exactly, the point isn't smooth:\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<    \[Bullet] Less than 2\[Pi]s is a sharp, cone-like \
point (a deficit angle)\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<    \[Bullet] More than 2\[Pi]s is a saddle-like \
excess.\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<    Smoothness requires the circumference to equal \
exactly 2\[Pi]s.\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<    We now apply the smoothness constraint:\>\"", 
     "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<       \>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{"\[Pi]", " ", "m", " ", 
       SubscriptBox["p", "5"], "s"}], ",", "\"\< = \>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{"2", "\[Pi]", " ", "s"}]}], "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<    \[Implies]  \>\"", ",", "\[Chi]", ",", "\"\< = \>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", 
       FractionBox["1", "m"]}], ",", "\"\< = \>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", 
       FractionBox[
        SubscriptBox["p", "5"], "2"]}]}], "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<    This concludes proof of the claim.\>\"", "]"}], 
    ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", "\"\<Notes\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<(1) To claim smoothness, the full \
\!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(ds\), \(2\)]\) line element involving t, r, \[Theta], \
\[Phi], \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[Psi]\), \(4\)]\), and \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\
\[Psi]\), \(5\)]\) must be considered. The transverse line element used to \
prove the claim involves just r and \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[Psi]\), \(5\)]\). \
However since there are no off-diagonal metric terms \
\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(g\), \(\[Mu]\[Nu]\)]\), there is no mixing of different \
directions. Consequently, the entire 6D spacetime is smooth if the transverse \
space is.\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<(2) The \!\(\*FractionBox[\(\[Chi]\), \(r\)]\) term is \
replaced in the \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[GothicCapitalD]\), \(5\)]\)(r) pattern \
by -\!\(\*FractionBox[SubscriptBox[\(p\), \(5\)], \(2  r\)]\) because \[Chi] \
is no longer a free constant.\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Print", "[", "\"\<(3) \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(p\), \(5\)]\), by contrast, \
remains a free constant, as does \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(p\), \(4\)]\).\>\"", 
     "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
