Cell[BoxData["\<\"Note. \\!\\(\\*SuperscriptBox[\\(T\\), \\(2\\)]\\) is \
homogeneous but not isotropic. Thus, the solution is expected to have more \
free parameters than the 6D_2 case where the compact curled space is a \
2-sphere, \\!\\(\\*SuperscriptBox[\\(S\\), \\(2\\)]\\).\"\>"], "Print",
