\\\",FontWeight->\\\"Bold\\\"]\\)\\!\\(\\*StyleBox[\\\"element\\\",FontWeight-\
>\\\"Bold\\\"]\\). Any other portion of the line element, such as the \
(r,\\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[\\(\[Psi]\\), \\(5\\)]\\)) line element, above, is \
referred to as a \
\\!\\(\\*StyleBox[\\\"transverse\\\",FontWeight->\\\"Bold\\\"]\\)\\!\\(\\*\
StyleBox[\\\" \
\\\",FontWeight->\\\"Bold\\\"]\\)\\!\\(\\*StyleBox[\\\"line\\\",FontWeight->\\\
\"Bold\\\"]\\)\\!\\(\\*StyleBox[\\\" \
