\[GothicCapitalD]\\), \\(5\\)]\\)[r]\\)]\\)\\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[\\(p\\), \
\\(5\\)]\\) shrinks down to zero. This is the bubble: the curled \
\\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[\\(\[Psi]\\), \\(5\\)]\\)-direction pinches off \
completely at r=\\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[\\(r\\), \\(0\\)]\\). As r moves away \
from \\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[\\(r\\), \\(0\\)]\\), spacetime continues outward.\
\"\>"], "Print",
