Cell[BoxData["\<\"The plots below help visualize the pinch. In the plots, \\!\
\\(\\*SqrtBox[SubscriptBox[\\(\[GothicCapitalD]\\), \
\\(5\\)]]\\)\\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[\\(p\\), \\(5\\)]\\) are the \\nproper \
radii of the horizontal slices for various r-values. The upper plots \\nshow \
2D cross-sections of the height of the surface vs proper radii. \\nThe lower \
plots revolve the upper plots to form surfaces of revolution in \\nordinary \
3-space. \"\>"], "Print",
